pan> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Selune.27s_Blessing:_Lunar_Brand\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Selune's_Blessing:_Lunar_Brand\"> Condition: Selune's Blessing: Lunar Brand </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Selune%27s_Blessing:_Lunar_Brand_(Condition)\" title=\"Selune's Blessing: Lunar Brand (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Selune's Blessing: Lunar Brand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Selune%27s_Blessing_Lunar_Brand_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Selune%27s_Blessing:_Lunar_Brand_(Condition)\" title=\"Selune's Blessing: Lunar Brand (Condition)\">Selune's Blessing: Lunar Brand</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Your attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Selune.27s_Blessing:_Moonsnare\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Selune's_Blessing:_Moonsnare\"> Condition: Selune's Blessing: Moonsnare </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Selune%27s_Blessing:_Moonsnare_(Condition)\" title=\"Selune's Blessing: Moonsnare (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Selune's Blessing: Moonsnare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Selune%27s_Blessing:_Moonsnare_(Condition)\" title=\"Selune's Blessing: Moonsnare (Condition)\">Selune's Blessing: Moonsnare</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"WIS Save (DC&nbsp;14)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;14)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">Movement speed</a> halved.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Dancing_Lights\"> Area: Dancing Lights </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights_(area)\" title=\"Dancing Lights (area)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp/45px-Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp/60px-Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dancing Lights\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights_(area)\" title=\"Dancing Lights (area)\">Dancing Lights</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>Illuminates 9 m (30 ft) radius.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Summoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Summoned</a></dd>\n\n</dl> </span>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night\" title=\"Selûne's Spear of Night\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night\" title=\"Selûne's Spear of Night\">Selûne's Spear of Night</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Creates an area called Selune's Blessing: Moonmote Aura that applies Selune's Blessing: Lunar Brand and Selune's Blessing: Moonsnare to creatures inside it and lasts for 10 turns.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The spell tooltip states that this aura applies only to melee attacks while the condition tooltip states that this aura applies to \"attacks\".  In actuality, it applies to weapon and unarmed attacks, but does not apply to any spells which are also attacks.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715043242\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.108 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.114 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5201/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 84014/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 33043/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 36/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1581403/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n121.54%  116.342     72 Template:Trim\n100.00%   95.727      1 Template:Featu